{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2021-07-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'BONNIE EVELYN NAMED CIGNA MARKET PRESIDENT FOR GEORGIA/ALABAMA', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JULY 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CIGNA (NYSE:CI) HAS NAMED BONNIE EVELYN AS MARKET PRESIDENT FOR ITS HEALTH CARE AND RELATED BENEFITS PLANS IN GEORGIA/ALABAMA. SHE REPLACES FORMER MARKET\xa0PRESIDENT BRYAN HOLGERSON, WHO WAS PROMOTED TO CHIEF UNDERWRITING OFFICER FOR CIGNA U.S. COMMERCIAL.'}